.\" Man page for bifold-gui(1).
.TH BIFOLD-GUI 1 "2026-11-22" "Bifold" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
bifold\-gui \- two\-pane file manager, desktop window
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bifold\-gui
.RI [ PATH ]
.RB [ \-\-left
.IR DIR ]
.RB [ \-\-right
.IR DIR ]
.RB [ \-\-path
.IR DIR ]
.RB [ \-\-theme
.IR NAME ]
.RB [ \-\-list\-themes ]
.RB [ \-\-no\-config ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B bifold\-gui
is the desktop front end of Bifold: the same two\-panel file manager as
.BR bifold (1),
in a native window.
Both programs share one core, so the key bindings, themes and preferences in
.I ~/.config/bifold/config.toml
apply to both, and every operation behaves identically.
.PP
Keyboard shortcuts follow the same keymap as the terminal program
.RB ( Cmd
and
.B Ctrl
are interchangeable); the mouse selects (click), marks (Cmd\- or Shift\-click),
enters (double\-click) and resizes the panes (drag the divider), and the toolbar
mirrors every action.
Press
.B h
for the help window.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-l ", " \-\-left " " \fIDIR\fR
Directory for the left pane.
.TP
.BR \-r ", " \-\-right " " \fIDIR\fR
Directory for the right pane.
.TP
.BR \-p ", " \-\-path " " \fIDIR\fR
Directory for both panes.
.TP
.BI \-\-theme " NAME"
Colour theme for this run only.
.TP
.B \-\-list\-themes
List the built\-in and user themes and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-config
Ignore the configuration file and do not write one.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show a short help text and exit.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Show the version and exit.
.SH FILES
See
.BR bifold (1).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR bifold (1)
